  "ingredients": [
    "cooking spray",
    "2 cups rolled oats",
    "0.5 cup shredded coconut",
    "0.5 cup honey",
    "2 tablespoons creamy peanut butter",
    "1 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "0.125 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 325 degrees F (165 degrees C). Grease a 9-inch square baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M9nyXat73N_RnUBWMXMP3fYb_OY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-223467-Granola-Bars-ddmfs-step-1-47915e0539fa4e6fac817cc347156076.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223467/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread oats and coconut evenly across a baking sheet. Toast oats and coconut in the preheated oven until browned, about 10 minutes; transfer to a large mixing bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hE_xVGsUXTUCYauxwBq0Von9DJ4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-223467-Granola-Bars-ddmfs-step-2-ee133884d9004c3abe17a7e967a961b5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223467/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix honey, peanut butter, vanilla, and salt in a saucepan over medium-low heat. Cook and stir until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/D8oUIgmRVnOwoOQblxuyBkDOrjE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-223467-Granola-Bars-ddmfs-step-3-76ee66f9bde441e5973da64e4782ea0d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223467/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour honey mixture over oats and coconut. Stir to coat. Spread mixture evenly into the prepared baking dish.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EF9J1Ti-hXV-6kgClZJGY_oP4Ck=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-223467-Granola-Bars-ddmfs-step-5-2da1f08eb5a446b2b22ef358d46d8392.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223467/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until beginning to dry, about 15 minutes for crunchy granola bars, less if you like them chewy.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NtfbMzR7HbtxpajY5mCyRTDjaT4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-223467-Granola-Bars-ddmfs-step-6-98aa379ac9e34b5f9b14625c5e18bd18.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/223467/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cool completely before cutting.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/CMV8J6kB9KockLf_J_Ncb0_s8hQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-223467-Granola-Bars-ddmfs-4x3-43a1421950074122a5477af757293bfb.jpg"
